{"data":{"title":"Adventures In the Land of Music","slug":"adventures-in-the-land-of-music","path":"/artists/dynasty/tracks/adventures-in-the-land-of-music/","artwork":"images/artists/dynasty/tracks/adventures-in-the-land-of-music.jpg","artist":{"id":"PqeWih7f9Qg","slug":"dynasty","links":null,"title":"Dynasty","artwork":null},"id":"h_8lOfBqHvA"},"appearanceCount":3,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"ir1mTfxJx_o","show":{"id":"-o3R3MpGKew","slug":"175","title":"Soulection Radio Show #175 (Rinse FM Announcement)","artwork":"/images/episodes/175.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) & [iiike](https://soundcloud.com/iiike) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-06-14T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"KUmEL6iLqUU","show":{"id":"m-HPm5L4pFs","slug":"316","title":"Soulection Radio Show #316","artwork":"/images/episodes/316.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-07-01T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":49730,"platform":"spotify","href":"https://open.spotify.com/track/2dq0kUm6b0JOBMvsu6N2j9","artwor